{"seq":2,"slug":"modern-forms-of-rsi","title":"RSI 的现代形态：AI 改进芯片、代码与算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/recursive-self-improvement/concept-and-history/modern-forms-of-rsi","wordCount":2210,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"rsi-的现代形态-ai-改进芯片-代码与算法\">RSI 的现代形态：AI 改进芯片、代码与算法</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>古德设想的是一台机器改写自身的代码；2025 年的现实形态不同——目前没有一个生产级系统在「改自己」，但 AI 已经深度介入<strong>制造下一代 AI 所需的每一个环节</strong>。把训练一个前沿模型的投入写成生产函数：产出能力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span> 由有效算力决定，而有效算力可以分解为物理算力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 与算法效率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 的乘积，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{eff}} = C \\cdot A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>（同样的损失函数下降，可以用更多芯片买到，也可以用更好的算法省出来）。RSI 的现代形态因此不是单点自我修改，而是三条并行的改进管线同时被 AI 加速：<strong>管线一</strong>改进 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>（用 AI 设计芯片与数据中心），<strong>管线二</strong>改进使用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 的软件过程（用 AI 写训练基础设施与应用代码），<strong>管线三</strong>改进 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>（用 AI 发现更优算法）。只要这三条管线中的任何一条出现显著的 AI 供给占比，「回路是否闭合」就从哲学问题变成了测量问题。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    D[&quot;数据中心:&lt;br/&gt;物理算力 C&quot;] --&gt; T[&quot;大规模训练:&lt;br/&gt;消耗 C 产出模型&quot;]&#10;    T --&gt; M[&quot;前沿模型:&lt;br/&gt;更强的编码与推理&quot;]&#10;    M --&gt; P[&quot;管线一:AI 设计芯片&lt;br/&gt;提高下一代 C&quot;]&#10;    M --&gt; S[&quot;管线二:AI 写软件&lt;br/&gt;降低研发人力成本&quot;]&#10;    M --&gt; K[&quot;管线三:AI 发现算法&lt;br/&gt;提高效率因子 A&quot;]&#10;    P --&gt; D&#10;    K --&gt; T&#10;    S --&gt; T\">graph TD\n    D[\"数据中心:&lt;br/&gt;物理算力 C\"] --&gt; T[\"大规模训练:&lt;br/&gt;消耗 C 产出模型\"]\n    T --&gt; M[\"前沿模型:&lt;br/&gt;更强的编码与推理\"]\n    M --&gt; P[\"管线一:AI 设计芯片&lt;br/&gt;提高下一代 C\"]\n    M --&gt; S[\"管线二:AI 写软件&lt;br/&gt;降低研发人力成本\"]\n    M --&gt; K[\"管线三:AI 发现算法&lt;br/&gt;提高效率因子 A\"]\n    P --&gt; D\n    K --&gt; T\n    S --&gt; T</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>管线</th>\n<th>改进的量</th>\n<th>代表系统</th>\n<th>自动化程度现状</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>芯片与算力</td>\n<td>物理算力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>AlphaChip、商用 EDA 工具、计算光刻</td>\n<td>局部环节替代专家数周工作，全流程仍需人类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>软件工程</td>\n<td>研发吞吐与迭代速度</td>\n<td>各家编码智能体</td>\n<td>大量合并的真实代码，复杂任务仍需人验收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>算法发现</td>\n<td>效率因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>AlphaDev、FunSearch、AlphaEvolve</td>\n<td>窄域可验证问题上超越人类最优解</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"管线一-让下一代芯片更便宜更快\">管线一：让下一代芯片更便宜更快</h2><p>强化学习做芯片宏单元布局的研究 2021 年发表于《自然》，Google 称其已用于最近三代 TPU（含第六代 Trillium）的设计，并在 2024 年以 AlphaChip 之名开源了预训练权重；商业 EDA 侧，Synopsys 与 Cadence 分别把类似的 RL 布局能力产品化为 DSO.ai 与 Cerebrus，晶圆厂与设计公司已在流片前流程中使用。再往下游，GPU 厂商把计算光刻搬到加速器上以缩短掩膜版迭代周期。这些环节的共同点是：<strong>它们都处在「下一代算力的关键路径」上</strong>。布局方案差一点，芯片频率、功耗、面积就差一截；光刻慢一周，新工艺就晚一周量产。AI 在关键路径上每节省一天，都等价于给整个行业的算力供给曲线加了一点斜率。此管线的完整证据链与争议见<a href=\"../evidence-today/ai-for-chip-design\">AI 用于芯片设计</a>。</p>\n<p>需要立即标注的边界是：芯片从设计到量产以年计，这是物理世界的交付周期，软件无法压缩。因此管线一对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 的贡献是<strong>提前期很长的一次性放大</strong>，而非即时的回路增益——这正是它与管线二、三的本质区别。</p>\n<h2 id=\"管线二-让研发本身变快\">管线二：让研发本身变快</h2><p>第三条最容易被低估的管线是软件工程自身。前沿实验室的训练栈——数据管道、并行策略、评估脚手架——本质上是代码库，而编码正是当前模型最强的领域之一。SWE-bench Verified 上前沿系统的成绩在两年间从约五成推进到七至八成区间（swebench.com 公开榜单已出现 Claude 4.5 Opus、Gemini 3 Flash 等系统的高分条目），意味着相当一部分常规工程任务不再排队等人。对 RSI 而言，关键不是「AI 能不能独立写出产品」，而是<strong>实验吞吐量</strong>：一次消融实验从「工程师排两天队」变成「智能体并行跑二十个」，研究迭代周期就被压缩了。METR 把这种压缩变成可测量的时间倍增线（约每 7 个月翻倍的任务时长），也用一个反直觉的随机对照试验提醒我们感知与现实存在落差，两者均见<a href=\"../evidence-today/rnd-acceleration-metr\">METR 时间倍增线</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"管线三-让算法效率翻倍\">管线三：让算法效率翻倍</h2><p>Epoch AI 对语言模型历史数据的估计显示，达到同等性能所需的算力大约每 8 个月减半一次（95% 置信区间 5–14 个月），远快于硬件端摩尔定律的两年节奏——算法进步一直是有效算力增长中被低估的引擎。AI 反哺这条管线的方式在 2023–2025 年间发生了质变：AlphaDev 用强化学习改写排序内联函数进入 LLVM 标准库；FunSearch 让大模型与自动评估器配对搜索，在帽集问题与装箱启发式上刷新已知界；AlphaEvolve 进一步把进化搜索接到前沿大模型上，将四阶复矩阵乘法的标量乘法次数从 Strassen 1969 年的 49 次降到 48 次，并把找到的数据中心调度方案投入 Google 生产环境持续回收约 0.7% 的全球算力。方法论的完整拆解见<a href=\"../evidence-today/ai-for-algorithm-discovery\">AI 发现算法</a>。</p>\n<p>注意这条管线的共同前提：<strong>候选解的正确性可以被机器自动判定</strong>——排序有测试集，矩阵乘法有数值验证，调度方案有模拟器。凡是评估昂贵的领域（开放性研究、安全分析），进化搜索就转不动。这个「验证先行」的结构将在<a href=\"../takeoff-debate/real-bottlenecks\">真实瓶颈</a>中成为中心论题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自举份额-回路是否闭合的操作化判据\">自举份额：回路是否闭合的操作化判据</h2><p>三条管线给出后，「RSI 是否已经发生」可以被重述为一个可测量的量：<strong>自举份额</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——在第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 轮能力提升中，由上一代 AI 直接贡献的有效增量占比。写成增益分解：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi><mtext>human</mtext></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_t = g_{t}^{\\text{human}} + s_t \\cdot (g_t - 1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1461em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">human</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为总增益，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_t = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 表示全部改进来自人类努力，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_t \\to 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示改进过程基本自给。当前公开证据给出的量级是：管线一约在个别环节贡献了周级的日程节省与个位数的面积功耗优化；管线二的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在头部实验室的工程工时上已达两位数百分比但仍需人类验收；管线三产出了若干「教科书级」的单点突破，但在训练效率总盘子中占比仍小。换言之，回路<strong>处处漏气但处处在补</strong>。把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 变成跨季度可比的仪表盘，是治理侧最紧迫的技术任务，具体基准盘点见<a href=\"../governance-preparedness/measuring-rsi-capability\">把 RSI 能力变成可测指标</a>；而三条管线各自卡在哪里，则是下一篇的主题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"自举份额为何难以直接测量\">自举份额为何难以直接测量</h3><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的定义干净，落地却撞上三堵测量墙。第一是<strong>归因墙</strong>：一次能力跃升往往由多种来源叠加（更多算力、更好数据、算法改进、AI 辅助编码），公开信息很难把增量干净地拆给「上一代 AI 的贡献」这一项，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的估计区间常常宽到同时容纳两种叙事。第二是<strong>分母墙</strong>：自举份额是一个比值，而分母「本轮总增量」本身没有公认口径——按训练算力算、按工程工时算、按基准分数算，会得到量级不同的结果。第三是<strong>可比墙</strong>：基准每季更新，新旧版本的重叠区间若未经双轨校准，「这一代比上一代高多少」的先决条件就不成立。三堵墙合起来解释了为什么 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 至今没有跨实验室的统一读数——它缺的不是定义，而是共同的记账规则。</p>\n<p>因此对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的正确用法是把它当作<strong>方向指示器而非精确刻度</strong>：能判断「在变高还是变平」，不能判断「到底是 8% 还是 18%」。要把它推进到可触发制度的那一步，仍依赖治理侧讨论的第三方复测与基准轮换纪律。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>归因墙</strong>：多来源增量难以干净拆分给「上一代 AI」这一项。</li>\n<li><strong>分母墙</strong>：总增量按算力、工时或分数口径会得到量级不同的比值。</li>\n<li><strong>可比墙</strong>：基准漂移使跨代比较必须经双轨重叠校准才成立。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>现代 RSI 是分布式回路：AI 同时改进算力供给 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>、研发吞吐与算法效率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>，对应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{eff}}=C\\cdot A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 的两个因子加一个过程变量。</li>\n<li>三条管线均已产出生产级证据，但贡献结构不同：芯片管线是长提前期的一次性放大，软件管线改善吞吐，算法管线提供点状突破。</li>\n<li>自举份额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 目前处处为正、处处不高；把它变成跨季度仪表盘是治理侧最紧迫的技术任务。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"RSI 的现代形态：AI 改进芯片、代码与算法","id":"rsi-的现代形态-ai-改进芯片-代码与算法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"管线一：让下一代芯片更便宜更快","id":"管线一-让下一代芯片更便宜更快"},{"level":2,"text":"管线二：让研发本身变快","id":"管线二-让研发本身变快"},{"level":2,"text":"管线三：让算法效率翻倍","id":"管线三-让算法效率翻倍"},{"level":2,"text":"自举份额：回路是否闭合的操作化判据","id":"自举份额-回路是否闭合的操作化判据"},{"level":3,"text":"自举份额为何难以直接测量","id":"自举份额为何难以直接测量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"智能爆炸论的起源","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/recursive-self-improvement/concept-and-history/intelligence-explosion-origins"},"next":{"title":"为什么 RSI 至今没有发生","url":"/l-doc-books/h/agi-frontier/recursive-self-improvement/concept-and-history/why-rsi-is-hard"}}